&lt;p">-54&nbsp;</span>Aldrin, a chlorinated insecticide now banned from use in most countries since 1990, can be made by Diels&ndash;Alder reaction of hexachloro-1,3-cyclopentadiene with norbornadiene. What is the structure of aldrin?</p>

