&lt;p">&nbsp;</span>Norbornadiene (Problem 54) can be prepared by reaction of chloroethylene with 1,3-cyclopentadiene, followed by treatment of the product with sodium ethoxide. Write the overall scheme, and identify the two kinds of reactions.</p>

