<p><img alt="a=" data-height="188" data-width="588" style="width: 443px; height: 142px;" width="443px" height="142px" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/461047/94ea96a9219e756110853faa2402431414e989c4?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=443&amp;height=142" /></p>

